{
 "engine": "kokoro",
 "speed": 1.0,
 "before": 0.4,
 "between": 0.35,
 "after": 0.6,
 "voices": [
  {
   "id": "af_heart",
   "label": "Heart",
   "scenes": [
    {
     "sentences": [
      {
       "text": "A computer has an edge: the boundary.",
       "file": "voice/42e94d98d4cd9fad.mp3",
       "start": 0.4,
       "length": 2.065
      },
      {
       "text": "Everything that enters or leaves passes through Silo there.",
       "file": "voice/97dae9038541911c.mp3",
       "start": 2.815,
       "length": 3.16
      },
      {
       "text": "Each way through is a channel: the network, ports, files, secrets, the screen, the clipboard, repository access.",
       "file": "voice/9e791fa39a1bd9f8.mp3",
       "start": 6.325,
       "length": 6.8
      },
      {
       "text": "None exists by default.",
       "file": "voice/181cdf6538cb0490.mp3",
       "start": 13.475,
       "length": 1.484
      },
      {
       "text": "You add each one.",
       "file": "voice/2ec8555e55d08906.mp3",
       "start": 15.309,
       "length": 0.966
      }
     ],
     "total": 16.875
    },
    {
     "sentences": [
      {
       "text": "You set rules.",
       "file": "voice/ae8b0857fa810992.mp3",
       "start": 0.4,
       "length": 0.93
      },
      {
       "text": "Silo keeps them outside the computer, and nothing inside can change them.",
       "file": "voice/d1ae9f0ca68e0128.mp3",
       "start": 1.68,
       "length": 3.939
      },
      {
       "text": "Rules that live inside an agent program are not a boundary: the agent can get around them.",
       "file": "voice/3e8fa3a5cf7a22e4.mp3",
       "start": 5.969,
       "length": 5.187
      },
      {
       "text": "When something reaches the boundary, one of three things happens.",
       "file": "voice/d8f8713a95eae6ea.mp3",
       "start": 11.506,
       "length": 3.13
      },
      {
       "text": "It is allowed, and passes.",
       "file": "voice/40441f17f75ef8c0.mp3",
       "start": 14.986,
       "length": 1.488
      },
      {
       "text": "It is held, and waits for your answer.",
       "file": "voice/e90a4d726bbdfeb6.mp3",
       "start": 16.824,
       "length": 1.898
      },
      {
       "text": "Or it is denied, before anything passes.",
       "file": "voice/fed5f4acc65627e6.mp3",
       "start": 19.072,
       "length": 2.377
      },
      {
       "text": "Whatever no rule allows, and you have not said yes to, is denied.",
       "file": "voice/77391db97158e4bc.mp3",
       "start": 21.799,
       "length": 3.519
      }
     ],
     "total": 25.918
    },
    {
     "sentences": [
      {
       "text": "A hold makes only one thing wait: the request it is about.",
       "file": "voice/858cf4b0505f4ee7.mp3",
       "start": 0.4,
       "length": 3.401
      },
      {
       "text": "The computer keeps running.",
       "file": "voice/6dd606a119e4ef40.mp3",
       "start": 4.151,
       "length": 1.393
      },
      {
       "text": "What you see is an ask.",
       "file": "voice/b502957f6733c13e.mp3",
       "start": 5.894,
       "length": 1.201
      },
      {
       "text": "Your yes is a grant.",
       "file": "voice/d9070720028f8821.mp3",
       "start": 7.445,
       "length": 1.187
      },
      {
       "text": "The ask says exactly what it lets pass.",
       "file": "voice/9aca86123ee168cb.mp3",
       "start": 8.982,
       "length": 2.12
      },
      {
       "text": "And a hold always ends.",
       "file": "voice/92d29e40077c3162.mp3",
       "start": 11.452,
       "length": 1.45
      },
      {
       "text": "If you do not answer, Silo ends it at its own limit.",
       "file": "voice/9f3a4147b87376a5.mp3",
       "start": 13.252,
       "length": 2.888
      },
      {
       "text": "The request is denied, with an error the agent program can read.",
       "file": "voice/ccbcbafe72f0833d.mp3",
       "start": 16.49,
       "length": 3.611
      },
      {
       "text": "If the agent program gives up first and closes its connection, Silo sees that too.",
       "file": "voice/047658fe9f894943.mp3",
       "start": 20.451,
       "length": 4.62
      }
     ],
     "total": 25.671
    },
    {
     "sentences": [
      {
       "text": "Rules have no order.",
       "file": "voice/7ad2971be84434e5.mp3",
       "start": 0.4,
       "length": 1.17
      },
      {
       "text": "If one rule allows and another denies, deny wins.",
       "file": "voice/7b292420cec0a304.mp3",
       "start": 1.92,
       "length": 2.972
      },
      {
       "text": "Hold beats allow.",
       "file": "voice/e7fdcd79a260d1d2.mp3",
       "start": 5.242,
       "length": 1.019
      },
      {
       "text": "With no rule at all, it is denied.",
       "file": "voice/69bfeaaa144fc18b.mp3",
       "start": 6.611,
       "length": 1.809
      },
      {
       "text": "So the order in which you wrote them never changes the result.",
       "file": "voice/feeda33e306cfa1f.mp3",
       "start": 8.77,
       "length": 3.417
      }
     ],
     "total": 12.787
    },
    {
     "sentences": [
      {
       "text": "A deny forbids one thing, and the computer keeps running.",
       "file": "voice/955fe7edf37b6892.mp3",
       "start": 0.4,
       "length": 3.078
      },
      {
       "text": "Pause and stop act on the whole computer.",
       "file": "voice/89596d71ae339274.mp3",
       "start": 3.828,
       "length": 2.219
      },
      {
       "text": "Pause freezes everything, nothing is lost, and you can resume.",
       "file": "voice/12294a5b64772f07.mp3",
       "start": 6.397,
       "length": 3.426
      },
      {
       "text": "Stop ends the programs that were running.",
       "file": "voice/8034fe895cc46b21.mp3",
       "start": 10.173,
       "length": 2.036
      },
      {
       "text": "The disk stays.",
       "file": "voice/fba2374030b9627a.mp3",
       "start": 12.559,
       "length": 0.947
      }
     ],
     "total": 14.106
    },
    {
     "sentences": [
      {
       "text": "Every action Silo can take has a kind.",
       "file": "voice/6bfdbe10c84d116c.mp3",
       "start": 0.4,
       "length": 2.2
      },
      {
       "text": "Granting: the computer can do something it could not just before.",
       "file": "voice/04e24e6c2ea596ef.mp3",
       "start": 2.95,
       "length": 3.217
      },
      {
       "text": "Destructive: it ends or erases something, and that cannot be undone.",
       "file": "voice/bce7653b1c6fcb83.mp3",
       "start": 6.517,
       "length": 4.038
      },
      {
       "text": "Stop, restore and drop are here because each ends the programs that were running.",
       "file": "voice/6474c79f9f7f82a7.mp3",
       "start": 10.905,
       "length": 4.439
      },
      {
       "text": "The disk is not lost.",
       "file": "voice/5b98ffb338b1c4c8.mp3",
       "start": 15.694,
       "length": 1.319
      },
      {
       "text": "Protective: it grants nothing and destroys nothing.",
       "file": "voice/833e8f7980b93d91.mp3",
       "start": 17.363,
       "length": 2.921
      },
      {
       "text": "A wrong one costs only time.",
       "file": "voice/4aa1f956f22b54d0.mp3",
       "start": 20.634,
       "length": 1.528
      },
      {
       "text": "Anything added to Silo says the kind of each of its actions first.",
       "file": "voice/722b60e58d09dcb2.mp3",
       "start": 22.512,
       "length": 3.709
      }
     ],
     "total": 26.821
    }
   ],
   "total": 122.178
  }
 ]
}
